Alembic migrations for LifeLink.

The database URL is taken from the DATABASE_URL environment variable
(see alembic/env.py), not from alembic.ini.

Common commands:
  alembic upgrade head            # apply all migrations
  alembic downgrade -1            # roll back one
  alembic revision -m "message"   # new (hand-edited) migration
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "message"   # diff models vs db
